Map data from OpenStreetMap. The derived site grids, route graph and basemap
tile extract in shared/grid/ are made available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0, not under the Apache License; shared/grid/README.md says how each
was made. The basemap tiles are Protomaps Basemap layers from OpenStreetMap and
Natural Earth (public domain).

Search distances: the dementia distance rings (the 25, 50, 75 and 95 percent
distances from the point last seen, with each column's case count) are ISRID
figures from R. J. Koester, Lost Person Behavior, "Dementia (Alzheimer's)",
p. 164, read from the publisher's public sample at
https://www.dbs-sar.com/LPB/Dementia.pdf. docs/evidence/isrid-dementia-p164.md
gives the figures as printed, and docs/evidence/search-math-sources.md lists the
other published sources the search math uses.

